BEGIN_DESC
TANTRA BETA 15 - Earth, a stock Delta Glider at KSC.
The astronavigator in her coverall stands 16 m before the nose of a Delta Glider (stock, not changed) on the KSC runway.
Walk up to the nose and look at it: the crew's menu shows its nose airlock (Alt: the places of actions, orange).
"open the airlock" - the nose cone (K) and the outer door (O) open, as if pressed on the glider (about 20 s).
"go in" (the airlock open) - she is aboard: the glider has the focus and the view, you fly it.
To get out: F on the glider, standing on the ground with the airlock open - she steps out before the nose.
The glider's airlock is described in Config\OrbiterCrew\Ships\DeltaGlider.cfg (every Delta Glider in any scenario).
END_DESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 58710.6
END_ENVIRONMENT

